{ "exclude": "S478 open-Qs ruling (user-voice) item 26 (2): in the §66 dialect `export <Card title:string> … </Card>` reads as a §66 declaration export (§66.2.5 — `title:string` a field), not a §21.2 Form 1 component export, and Form 1 retires with the §66.15 component migration. The §66 analogue of E-EXPORT-003 (an own-value field colliding with its `renders` root attribute) is not stated yet, so this case is not twinned until it is (g-boot-export-form1-library-entry-s478)." }
